			"notes": "## 2.3.0\n\nThis minor version came with many broader changes. There is now a **public** GitHub repository with the project moving under the **MIT license**. Additionally, I have switched to use **Architectury** with the goal of only using it for build configuration and not requiring it for players. \n\n**Features and Improvements:**\n- added configurable **hit markers**, enabled by default\n- added automatic config reloading\n- show indicators in 3rd person\n\n**Other changes:**\n- config now located in `jeremyseqsdamageindicators.toml`\n\n**Bug fixes:**\n- fix directional indicator fade not working on Fabric"
